{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the horseshoes of Tornado, the legendary steed of Zorro, in this lighthearted 2D action-platformer. Race, leap, and kick your way through vibrant handcrafted worlds inspired by historical Spanish California. Combining fast-paced momentum-driven traversal, clever stealth, and a dash of swashbuckling humor, <i>Tornado \u2013 Caballo del Zorro</i> offers a fresh twist on classic side-scrolling adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey takes you from bustling villages to sun-scorched deserts and candle-lit haciendas, outsmarting a cast of quirky villains from a corrupt colonial regime. With each daring escape, you\u2019ll unlock new abilities, uncover secrets, and bring hope to those oppressed \u2014 all without ever dismounting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Playable Horse Hero</strong> \u2013 Control Tornado with a unique set of moves: wall climbs, long leaps, powerful kicks, and acrobatic dashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momentum-Driven Platforming</strong> \u2013 Master tight, fluid controls designed for speed and flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth &amp; Distraction</strong> \u2013 Outsmart enemies with cunning tricks and environmental interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Pixel Art</strong> \u2013 Explore richly detailed environments bursting with color and character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Campaign</strong> \u2013 Meet original, humorous characters across a swashbuckling tale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles</strong> \u2013 Face off against eccentric villains with unique patterns and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Secrets</strong> \u2013 Unlock new abilities and gear through exploration and clever play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Flair</strong> \u2013 Experience a whimsical yet adventurous tone, brought to life by expressive animation and a flamenco-inspired soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re here for the action, the puzzles, or the charm of being gaming\u2019s most charismatic horse, <i>Tornado \u2013 Caballo del Zorro</i> promises a ride you won\u2019t forget.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3200120?t=1773585079","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200120/ff502db54e6324277e700368ebedafad04f00ac4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773585079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200120/f887721824970de618717f936e074b48063d38e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773585079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200120/f887721824970de618717f936e074b48063d38e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773585079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3958180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the horseshoes of Tornado, the legendary steed of Zorro, in this lighthearted 2D action-platformer. Race, leap, and kick your way through vibrant handcrafted worlds inspired by historical Spanish California. Combining fast-paced momentum-driven traversal, clever stealth, and a dash of swashbuckling humor, <i>Tornado \u2013 Caballo del Zorro</i> offers a fresh twist on classic side-scrolling adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey takes you from bustling villages to sun-scorched deserts and candle-lit haciendas, outsmarting a cast of quirky villains from a corrupt colonial regime. With each daring escape, you\u2019ll unlock new abilities, uncover secrets, and bring hope to those oppressed \u2014 all without ever dismounting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Playable Horse Hero</strong> \u2013 Control Tornado with a unique set of moves: wall climbs, long leaps, powerful kicks, and acrobatic dashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momentum-Driven Platforming</strong> \u2013 Master tight, fluid controls designed for speed and flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth &amp; Distraction</strong> \u2013 Outsmart enemies with cunning tricks and environmental interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Pixel Art</strong> \u2013 Explore richly detailed environments bursting with color and character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Campaign</strong> \u2013 Meet original, humorous characters across a swashbuckling tale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles</strong> \u2013 Face off against eccentric villains with unique patterns and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Secrets</strong> \u2013 Unlock new abilities and gear through exploration and clever play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Flair</strong> \u2013 Experience a whimsical yet adventurous tone, brought to life by expressive animation and a flamenco-inspired soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re here for the action, the puzzles, or the charm of being gaming\u2019s most charismatic horse, <i>Tornado \u2013 Caballo del Zorro</i> promises a ride you won\u2019t forget.</p>","developers":["Dark Waters Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"descr